  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/02/IMG_1020.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Este domingo la nueva tienda Nubes de Az&uacute;car, en la avenida Montendre, esquina R&iacute;o Mijares de Onda, ha acogido el segundo curso entorno a San Valent&iacute;n. Esta vez ha sido para decoraci&oacute;n de galletas y el pasado domingo estuvo dedicado a decoraci&oacute;n de tartas. Peri&oacute;dicamente nubesdeazucar.es organiza cursos como &eacute;stos, adem&aacute;s de vender productos y utensilios.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursgalletessantvalentinubesazucar/img_1015.jpg\" alt=\"img_1015\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursgalletessantvalentinubesazucar/img_1016.jpg\" alt=\"img_1016\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursgalletessantvalentinubesazucar/img_1017.jpg\" alt=\"img_1017\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursgalletessantvalentinubesazucar/img_1018.jpg\" alt=\"img_1018\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursgalletessantvalentinubesazucar/img_1019.jpg\" alt=\"img_1019\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursgalletessantvalentinubesazucar/img_1020.jpg\" alt=\"img_1020\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursgalletessantvalentinubesazucar/img_1021.jpg\" alt=\"img_1021\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursgalletessantvalentinubesazucar/img_1022.jpg\" alt=\"img_1022\" style=\"max-